  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Build a HOME 4 HOPE for Ukrainians</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Krzysztof (Kris) Moll is a regular guy living in Osweicim, Poland.  He is doing EXTRAORDINARY work giving a home to Ukrainians fleeing Putin&apos;s War - personally housing 6 refugees in his own home and 7 in a home he had planned on selling.  Now, he is renovating a third home to house up to 20 refugees and HE NEEDS YOUR HELP!  Kris, when he&apos;s not delivering food to Ukrainians, is on site every day working with volunteers.  You can go to Poland to help with labor and/or DONATE HERE.  PRAY 4 PEACE!</narrative>
  </description>
